Although the house is built, there are still many things to do!
Plumbers will install pipes and faucets;
Electricians will lay wiring and install outlets;
Painters will paint the walls and ceilings;
Tile setters will lay tiles and flooring...
After all this is done, we can paint or put up wallpaper.

Wow, we can finally move into our new home!
Moving is tiring, but thinking about having a new house soon makes everyone so happy.
I drew a picture for the builder and even tried on his safety helmet.
Maybe one day, I can become a builder too!
